      "content": "LONDON ROAD 1. 5252                                                   (South Side)                                                   The Bell Inn TL 0505 4/182 II 2. C17 altered C19.  Colour washed brick, stucco and pebbledash.  Timber frame exposed on south side gable.  Old tiled roof with corbelled cornice.  2 storeys, 5 windows. C19 casements, 1st floor sash, ground floor canted bay. Listing NGR: TL0556905622"
    }
